## Summary of Changes

1. **Fixed Container Management**: Resolved name conflicts and improved container lifecycle management
2. **Corrected Static Asset Serving**: Fixed volume mounts and Caddy configuration for proper asset serving
3. **Enhanced Health Checks**: Added comprehensive health monitoring and failure handling
4. **Improved Deploy Script**: Made script idempotent with better error handling and logging
5. **Optimized Caddy Configuration**: Added proper health checks and timeout configuration
6. **Enhanced CI/CD Pipeline**: Improved smoke testing and environment variable handling
7. **Added Comprehensive Documentation**: Created detailed guides for deployment and troubleshooting
8. **Implemented Security Best Practices**: Proper permissions, secure environment handling
9. **Added Performance Optimizations**: Efficient static asset serving and communication
10. **Created Monitoring and Debugging Tools**: Comprehensive logging and status reporting

All changes are backward compatible and maintain the existing functionality while fixing the identified issues.